fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth265parser.html#gst_h265_parser_parse_slice_hdr","fragment":"\n\tgst_h265_parser_parse_slice_hdr\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265Parser.prototype.parse_slice_hdr\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265Parser.parse_slice_hdr\n\nParses data, and fills the slice structure.\nThe resulting slice_hdr structure shall be deallocated with\ngst_h265_slice_hdr_free when it is no longer needed\nParameters:\na GstH265Parser\nThe GST_H265_NAL_SLICE GstH265NalUnit to parse\nThe GstH265SliceHdr to fill.\na GstH265ParserResult\nParses data, and fills the slice structure.\nThe resulting slice_hdr structure shall be deallocated with\nGstCodecParsers.H265SliceHdr.prototype.free when it is no longer needed\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H265Parser\nThe GST_H265_NAL_SLICE GstCodecParsers.H265NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H265SliceHdr to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H265ParserResult\nParses data, and fills the slice structure.\nThe resulting slice_hdr structure shall be deallocated with\nGstCodecParsers.H265SliceHdr.free when it is no longer needed\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H265Parser\nThe GST_H265_NAL_SLICE GstCodecParsers.H265NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H265SliceHdr to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H265ParserResult\n"});